scheduler    io.github.pderop.looma.impl.JdkActorScheduler, Builtin[parallelism=10]
poller mode  not set
groups       10, 8000 users each (~640 KiB), depth 256
load         150,000 req/s, 4 connection(s) on CPUs [0, 1, 16, 17]
backend      127.0.0.1:8081, 8 connections per group
window       10s warm-up, 20s measured

ramp         from 150,000 req/s, 20,000 more at each step; at each step 10s measured and 3s to go up to it

